ily_agent_publication.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Resolve the committing run's own agent name[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]identity[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]identity: make commit-time agent attribution resolve the running [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]member's name rather than the stale lane/family name held in the process[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]environment, so footer links and publication requests both name a real [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]run.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make hood publication tolerate container-named requests[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]publish[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]publish: resolve an outbox request that names a pure family/clan [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]container to a concrete run in that hood so publication succeeds instead[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]of raising \"absent from project inventory\" and quarantining.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Self-healing agents sidecar transactions[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]sidecar_tx[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]sidecar_tx: guarantee a clean sidecar working tree before every rebase [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pull, clear stale index locks, and revert uncommitted payload writes on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]every early-return and exception path so one failed publish cannot wedge[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]all later ones.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Surface quarantined and stalled publications[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]visibility[dim] · [dim][/dim]after publish, sidecar_tx[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visibility: add a doctor check and stronger reporting for the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]publication outbox so quarantined or long-stalled requests are noticed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]instead of accumulating unseen for days.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Recover the backlog and verify end to end[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]backfill[dim] · [dim][/dim]after identity, publish, sidecar_tx[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]backfill: drain the existing outbox, re-publish the hoods that were [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]never written, and report which historical commit links remain [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]permanently dead.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-ad","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-ad.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-15440f0ba2fc650a4570353315ffb879","started_at":"2026-07-28T11:44:40.215434+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"0fdbd1ca4d2b0be4b254173ce4ea7d14645c46c32154cae22835423c4c8d44ad","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ad.5/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"a724e103affacd1a7739a82216210a6faf3bac64d95d29ac6dbf105133b0668b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ad.5/meta.json","size_bytes":599},"prompt":{"digest":"4d59b1fbda071e9f380d697339036865ea622aab492fa9faae8a29749ebfc378","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ad.5/prompt.md","size_bytes":211},"state":{"digest":"0732975471ab1d431dd2dda82b881922a42e3c1593a838a3cb137ef10909e2fd","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ad.5/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-ad.5","local_name":"sase-ad.5","metadata":{"agent_clan":"